<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7786" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναχάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make to recoil, force back,</i> found only in poet.
				aor. 1, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδ᾽
			ἀνέχασσαν</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				10.69
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly as 
				Pass.
			, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναχάζομαι</span></b> , 
				Ep.
			
			aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεχασσάμην</span>:—<i>draw
				back,</i> freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i> of warriors, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλ ἀναχασσάμενος λίθον εἵλετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					7.264
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				15.728
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.819
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17.47
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναχασσάμενος νῆχον πάλιν</span>
			<i>giving way to</i> the wave, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				7.280
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἠπείροιο</span>”
				<i>draw back from . .,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1241
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ πόδα ἀναχάζεσθαι</span>
			<i>retire</i> slowly, of soldiers, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.1.34
			</span></i>:—
				Act.
			 in sense of 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.1.16
			</span></i>.</div>
